{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_09_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:aaa4280ae5ca9ee3ed0fbdf6ef4cfd52b40e282710f308892cc917d33fa12100",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000008:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3081715a7ab3f7550973d10f6272f5a1a5f7de18c4e4300a531631f1e3d704e0",
      "text": "数日前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82241d94ce053f77c429c978477bca8c31d2fccf9b1826eb3c5d6f26e77e793b",
      "text": "所以说，别让我重复那么多次！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a19791e2d3877e8c519bd5654aa5337c097ef94d333cb3ec8eb7645b8364d5f2",
      "text": "所有的偶像都很出色，\n根本无法选出男极KING。因此……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f73795f7d3832ba3b5d26ca63c1408a001cdfa36b332ab6de5a3ed5ecb3063b3",
      "text": "向在大会上表现优异的前5名事务所颁发男极奖。\n男极联赛在没有KING的情况下就此结束！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edd88d648d570bf2cf8e40f84bd980e82cdae91b55c29ebdb7980936f34c1809",
      "text": "……这种收场方式我们无法接受。为了\n男极KING努力拼搏至今的偶像们会伤心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be0e3cadc8cc7b933d151a66db26e250b0cf5252d35fee217712bb0125a716c9",
      "text": "对给予过关照的各家公司和工作人员，\n又该怎么交代啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ebf6e58b5cdf3b81871bb08e45fab23471efff5e23380d7d11bcb2c31ad67b0",
      "text": "至少把知识部门办完吧！\n准备工作眼看就要做好了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c37033daf8f084e143f345487c4e93be3e572a5f70a91910151e4e5bf1f7325",
      "text": "不行，不行，立刻结束！\n要是知识部门也是对手们表现得更好怎么办？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f262e20617d0de46b9ceb335dabda76db526678f11d60f4938c48ff3232060e",
      "text": "我们事务所的颜面岂不是要丢得比现在更彻底了吗！\n……咳咳，不是这个意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cb72859ceec65433ba6a0750a3db0973d8c570e361d99295d5b93c910173cdd",
      "text": "有关各合作方，用不着担心。\n我已经向几家说明过了，反而是对方在道歉呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32fe757ef1af7324aaa157ad9280f5d1adea14df786937810009c491ae1ff97b",
      "text": "说是由于自己协助不力，\n才导致大赛出现了诸多疏漏，非常抱歉云云。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6aca516263571fa4454681ac5eff71e309898ffb2637064acd1ed4e6447b18e5",
      "text": "（明明全是我在暗中搞鬼……哼，就算他们察觉到了，\n对着我也不敢说出口吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55f80de519d45b8f3d3bc44036c13411ed2bf6d611ed839024aa2b660bd0f670",
      "text": "再说偶像们不仅不会悲伤，反而会高兴吧。\n毕竟原本只有1个的胜者名额，增加到了5个啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6a617209c3357850b75b55cc05eefc02528055ce0a53bd80d475ebe7febdd5f",
      "text": "（……不过，我可不会平白无故就把男极奖给你们）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63b194a1c8d29c64e3e4711beaf97c58bb38d11e641280d3e702f766bc49a42d",
      "text": "（你们三番五次打乱我的计划，\n我定要让你们付出代价。给我做好觉悟吧！）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
